      "name": "How does solid wood furniture compare to wood veneer furniture in durability?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "100% solid wood furniture offers superior durability, repairability, and longevity compared to veneer furniture. While veneer consists of a thin sheet of wood glued over particleboard or MDF that can peel or chip permanently, solid hardwood can be sanded, re-oiled, and repaired over decades, developing a beautiful natural patina."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What finishes does WRYDECO apply to handcrafted solid wood furniture?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "WRYDECO finishes handcrafted solid wood furniture with plant-based, zero-VOC hardwax oils that penetrate deep into the timber grain. This non-toxic finish protects against moisture and household spills while keeping the wood breathable and safe for residential living environments."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How long does it take for handcrafted solid wood furniture to be crafted and delivered?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Estimated processing and crafting takes approximately 15 to 20 business days, followed by an estimated 3 to 5 business days in transit after dispatch, for a total estimated delivery window of 18 to 25 business days. Timelines are estimates rather than guaranteed delivery dates."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I cancel or modify my order if I need a different size or finish?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. WRYDECO provides a 6-hour Golden Window immediately after ordering during which you can cancel your order for a 100% free refund or change size, finish, and shipping details by contacting support@wrydeco.com. Once the 6-hour window closes, production begins and orders cannot be canceled."
      }
    }
